# Some self-test assertions compare against the source text, while the chunking function normalizes \r\n to \n internally.
# If a .txt is checked out as CRLF on Windows, those assertions fail spuriously (issue #8).
# All text is checked out as LF, which avoids this whole class of problem at the root.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
